     * via the fixed region-to-timezone table ({@code NSW->Australia/Sydney},
     * {@code VIC->Australia/Melbourne}, {@code QLD->Australia/Brisbane}). Returns {@code null} when the
     * owner's region is not one of the tabled regions.
     */
